[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Goek.Greetings.Text | {{emote|*reeeeeps joyfully*}}\n\nGreetings, =name=! Live and drink, friend. => {{emote|*欢快地 reeeeeps*}}\n\n问候你，=name=！生而饮水，朋友。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Goek.Freehold.Text | {{emote|*reeeeeps joyfully*}}\n\nYd shared together. rrk walk and feel safe and free as woodsmoke. Here, there through the corals. Under the pipes.\n\nGreat pond and reef air, eat starapple and drink, see pattern on the bright slugs. => {{emote|*欢快地 reeeeeps*}}\n\n伊德共同分享。呱 行走，感到安全又自由，像木烟一样。这里，那里，穿过珊瑚。在管道下方。\n\n大池塘和礁中空气，吃星苹果并饮水，看明亮蛞蝓身上的图案。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Geeub.Query.Text | {{emote|*grrrk*}}\nWe ask, we answer.\n\nWe call, we respond. => {{emote|*grrrk*}}\n我们问，我们答。\n\n我们呼唤，我们回应。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Geeub.Whomst.Text | Over time, Geeub. Good as any.\n\n{{emote|*roooak*}}\n\nNames, ehh. => 久而久之，吉厄布。和别的名字一样好。\n\n{{emote|*roooak*}}\n\n名字，呃。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Geeub.Laughing.Text | Hoh hoh hoh hoh.\n\n{{emote|*grrrrrk*}}\n\nWe have fun. => 呵呵呵呵。\n\n{{emote|*grrrrrk*}}\n\n我们有乐趣。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Geeub.Founder.Text | 'Founder' the query. 'Founder' is water-taking, no? To be breached and sink. How cruel the judgment.\n\n{{emote|*rrrrroak*}}\n\nHoh hoh. This voice japes -- we, witness to the birth of Yd. The query, no? => “创立者”是问题。“奠基者”也是进水，不是吗？被破开，然后沉没。多么残酷的判定。\n\n{{emote|*rrrrroak*}}\n\n呵呵。这个声音在玩笑——我们，见证了伊德的诞生。问题如此，不是吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Krka.Start.Text | Live and =player.formalAddressTerm=!\n\n{{emote|*self-conscious rkkk*}}\n\nDr... drink and =player.formalAddressTerm=!\n\nKrka, me. Krka. => 生而 =player.formalAddressTerm=！\n\n{{emote|*不自在地 rkkk*}}\n\n饮……饮水而 =player.formalAddressTerm=！\n\n克尔卡，我。克尔卡。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Krka.Krka.Text | {{emote|*gweep!*}}\n\nKrka, me! => {{emote|*gweep!*}}\n\n克尔卡，我！
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Krka.Apothecary2.Text | Krka poth!\n\n{{emote|*affirmative rrk!*}}\n\nEel woon a-banjage. Wikky wood, orsh room, jector! All sale, wants? => 克尔卡药罐！\n\n{{emote|*肯定地 rrk！*}}\n\n鳗伤要绷带。维基木，奥什菇，注射器！全卖，想要？
